@startuml ShopeeFood Chatbot Backend Architecture

title Sơ đồ thành phần Backend - ShopeeFood Chatbot AI

package "Client Layer (Frontend)" {
    [Web App UI] as UI <<NextJS / React>>
    [State Manager] as State <<React Context / Hooks>>
    
    UI --> State : Trigger actions
}

package "Backend Server Layer" {
    [API Controller] as Controller <<Express / FastAPI>>
    [LLM Client Service] as LLMService <<LangChain / Google GenAI SDK>>
    [Code-level Validator] as Validator <<Custom Logic>>
    
    State --> Controller : REST Calls (POST /api/chat)
    Controller --> LLMService : Format Prompts & Request LLM
    Controller --> Validator : Check LLM Output
}

package "Data & External Layer" {
    database "Restaurant DB" as DB <<mock_restaurants.json>> {
        folder "Schema" {
            [id]
            [name]
            [address]
            [opening_hours]
            [dishes (price, status)]
        }
    }
    
    [Google Gemini API] as LLM <<External LLM API>>
    
    Controller --> DB : Query open shops in radius (Pre-filtering)
    Validator --> DB : Validate IDs (Post-filtering)
    LLMService --> LLM : Call LLM with Context & Prompt
}

note right of LLMService
  **System Prompt:**
  - Định dạng JSON
  - Nghiêm cấm bịa quán
  - Hỏi lại nếu mơ hồ
end note

note bottom of Validator
  **Anti-Hallucination:**
  Đảm bảo mọi ID do LLM gợi ý
  đều là thật và đang mở cửa.
end note

@endum
